{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07312","headline":"严子濑东送马处直归苏 · 刘长卿","name":"严子濑东送马处直归苏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望君舟已远，落日潮未退。\n目送沧海帆，人行白云外。\n江中远回首，波上生微霭。\n秋色姑苏台，寒流子陵濑。\n相送苦易散，动别知难会。\n从此日相思，空令减衣带。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}